mdCollab
========

mdCollab is an independent fork of HedgeDoc 2.

Upstream project: HedgeDoc
Upstream repository: https://github.com/hedgedoc/hedgedoc
Upstream commit used for this fork: c937fd26b5d20ca8b2c5fd26e5b467f0a5c03e08

