See LICENSE and LICENSES/AGPL-3.0-only.txt for the full license text.

Modifications in this fork include, among other things:
- Rebranding from HedgeDoc to mdCollab.
- Replacement of HedgeDoc logo and icon assets with mdCollab placeholders.
- Renaming of environment variables from HD_* to MDCOLLAB_*.
- Renaming of the note API header and session cookie.
- Removal of upstream community, documentation-site, and registry URLs.
- Removal of upstream workflows that performed remote actions.

